# OpenClaw Agent Brief

## What This Is

OpenClaw is a multi-vertical AI platform deployed on Render. It provides legal counsel, conference intelligence (AACR), skill generation (Archon), workflow orchestration, and a training flywheel (double-dip router + Modal LoRA dispatch).

## Live Deployment

- **Frontend**: `https://openclaw-saas-bw47.onrender.com` (static site)
- **API**: `https://zetabridge-api-q33d.onrender.com` (web service, port 3001)
- **Postgres**: `zeta-caid-prod` (Render free tier, expires 2026-08-29)
- **Qdrant**: `https://e255b8ee-5901-402d-9d23-74ea1d8485a1.eu-west-2-0.aws.cloud.qdrant.io`
- **GitHub**: `https://github.com/fjkiani/openclaw-saas` (branch: main, auto-deploy on push)

