## What NOT To Do

- Do not use OpenRouter — all keys are dead.
- Do not use `GOOGLE_AI_API_KEY` — the correct env var is `GOOGLE_API_KEY`.
- Do not create mock/stub data for Crunchbase — return an honest error if no API key.
- Do not write to existing Qdrant collections — use `openclaw_` prefixed collections only.
- Do not use `DEFAULT 'stub'` for compute_backend — use `DEFAULT 'modal'`.
